Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.22,0:01:04.67,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Crap. I'm gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.09,0:01:15.38,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.51,0:01:17.59,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.23,0:01:22.41,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to become a \Nmithril-class adventurer!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.91,0:01:54.76,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.71,0:02:00.04,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Wait, wait. This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:09.98,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.76,0:03:48.78,Main - Top,SIGN,0,0,0,,Episode.01 Unwanted Undead
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.97,0:03:54.01,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,The day starts early for adventurers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.40,0:03:56.72,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,Which sounds nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.19,0:03:59.77,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,but the day starts early \Nfor most poor people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.30,0:04:06.65,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,The only people who sleep until \Nnoon are nobles, wealthy merchants,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.65,0:04:08.59,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,and scholars living disorderly lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.59,0:04:10.16,Narration,RENNT,0,0,0,,Maybe that's just my bias talking, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.10,0:04:12.95,Narration,RENNT,0,0,0,,But my scholar friend sometimes forget
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.95,0:04:16.53,Narration,RENNT,0,0,0,,to sleep for days because they're \Nso focused on their research.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.91,0:04:19.05,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,I should check in on them soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.92,0:04:24.86,Narration,RENNT,0,0,0,,Either way, it's not something a\N low bronze-class adventurer,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.86,0:04:27.00,Narration,RENNT,0,0,0,,born and raised in a town\N too small to be on the map,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.00,0:04:30.52,Narration,RENNT,0,0,0,,Rentt Faina, knows anything about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.36,0:04:32.33,Flashback,RENTT,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.65,0:04:36.24,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,There's one reason adventurers get up early,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.86,0:04:39.04,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,and that's to get good jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:45.54,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,The adventurers' guild provides us with \Njobs suitable for our rank and skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.35,0:04:49.96,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,All manner of jobs are available, \Nsuch as monster extermination,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:54.43,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,protection, herb and material gathering, \Nand even cleaning muck out of drains.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.43,0:04:55.73,Flashback,ADVENTURER A,0,0,0,,Hey, Rentt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.55,0:04:57.83,Flashback,RENTT,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.83,0:05:00.13,Flashback,ADVENTURER B,0,0,0,,Are you going to the Labyrinth of \NThe Moon's Reflection again today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:02.08,Flashback,RENTT,0,0,0,,If there aren't any good jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.08,0:05:04.33,Flashback,ADVENTURER C,0,0,0,,How do you work so hard every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.33,0:05:05.97,Flashback,ADVENTURER A,0,0,0,,Well, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.97,0:05:07.33,Flashback,RENTT,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.33,0:05:08.67,Flashback,ADVENTURER B,0,0,0,,You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.84,0:05:08.67,Flashback,ADVENTURER C,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:19.83,Flashback,RENTT,0,0,0,,Guess I'll go to the \NLabyrinth of The Moon's Reflection.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.01,0:05:25.85,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,Most adventurers form parties, \Nbut I generally work solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.11,0:05:30.22,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,There are a few reasons for that, \Nbut mostly, it's because I'm not very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.99,0:05:33.40,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,Even though I've been \Nadventuring for ten years,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.40,0:05:36.79,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,I'm still only bronze, \Nthe second lowest rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:50.16,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,But even I can make a living
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.16,0:05:54.04,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,hunting monsters and selling magic \Nstones and materials to the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.71,0:05:55.77,Flashback,SHOPKEEPER,0,0,0,,Thank you. Come again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:59.56,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,Most of all, I live conscientiously \Nfor an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.31,0:06:03.09,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,I've even got an emergency fund.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:15.69,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,But in that moment, I lost my prudence \Nthat's essential to all adventurers...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.03,0:06:19.29,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,because in the thoroughly-explored
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.29,0:06:22.35,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,and completely deserted \NLabyrinth of The Moon's Reflection,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.18,0:06:25.80,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,I found something unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.90,0:06:37.14,Flashback,RENTT,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.56,0:06:40.22,Flashback,RENTT,0,0,0,,A secret passageway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.35,0:06:47.13,Flashback,RENTT,0,0,0,,What a discovery!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.27,0:06:59.55,Flashback,RENTT,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.49,0:07:02.11,Flashback,RENTT,0,0,0,,This is an unexplored area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.74,0:07:07.58,Flashback,RENTT,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll find some valuable \Nmagical equipment or weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:13.07,Flashback_Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,No, I could make a killing simply \Nreporting this news to the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.17,0:07:17.05,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,I should've ignored it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.89,0:07:22.27,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,but I went charging right into that \Nsuspicious and dangerous place alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.79,0:07:25.77,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,Because I'm a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.62,0:07:36.69,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,I found myself facing a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:40.71,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,The greatest of all monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.71,0:07:42.05,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,A real dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:45.59,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,According to legend, they take many forms,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.59,0:07:49.07,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,and some are considerably larger \Nthan most standard dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.83,0:07:52.43,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,Regardless, I realized right away\N that it was a dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:54.92,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,even though I'd never seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:57.13,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,Its sheer presence—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.13,0:07:59.92,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,the pressure it exerted that \Nfroze me to the spot—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:02.05,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,attested that it was a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.63,0:08:05.05,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,As the thousand-year \Nbronze-class adventurer,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.03,0:08:09.82,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,I stood no chance against \Nsuch an exceptional creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.73,0:08:16.83,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,How am I alive after being eaten by a dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.74,0:08:21.04,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,No, wait. Am I actually alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:27.14,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I'm very obviously a skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.22,0:08:32.62,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I'm an immortal monster known as an undead,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:39.03,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,but a bishop or priest could easily \Ndestroy me with their purification magic
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:44.66,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,because undead violate \Nthe divine providence
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.66,0:08:46.93,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,that the dead are not meant for this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.77,0:08:51.07,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,When I think of it that way, \Ndoes that mean I died?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.81,0:08:54.98,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,No, I'm still conscious and have my memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.98,0:08:57.14,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I should return to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:04.70,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,No, I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.70,0:09:06.42,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I don't want to die yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:09.96,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,No, wait. I'm already dead, \Nso I don't want to be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.66,0:09:12.60,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I'm confused!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.60,0:09:14.95,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,An adventurer mustn't lose his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.73,0:09:18.58,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,There's no point in thinking about \Nquestions I can't answer right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.36,0:09:26.92,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,The dragon seems to be gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:30.33,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,but I should start by getting away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.48,0:09:33.90,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,These labyrinths can be \Nfound around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.90,0:09:37.37,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,Many researches are trying \Nto explain their mysteries,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.37,0:09:40.42,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,but no one really knows where \Nthey come from or how they work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.07,0:09:43.75,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,Labyrinths come in various sizes,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.75,0:09:46.13,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,but precious magical equipment and \Ntreasures slumber within them,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.13,0:09:48.59,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,and monsters can be found \Naround every corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.49,0:09:52.40,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,Monsters are mysterious, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.01,0:09:57.76,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Everyone's likely at the Labyrinth of the \NNew Moon where there's good money to be had.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.50,0:10:02.25,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,In a few days, some solo adventurers \Nlike me should come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:04.27,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I'll try asking them for advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.97,0:10:05.51,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.09,0:10:09.09,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,First I need to figure out \Nhow I'll talk to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.55,0:10:11.42,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:21.60,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,My body feels heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:25.85,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Maybe because I have no muscles, \Nmy physical abilities are significantly worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.85,0:10:27.93,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I'm even less capable \Nthan an ordinary person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:30.40,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,That's to be expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.40,0:10:32.67,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,After all, I'm a skeleton now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:37.33,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I could defeat them easily as a human, \Nbut I need to be careful now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.37,0:10:41.25,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I can't raise my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.25,0:10:42.30,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,That's not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.61,0:11:04.23,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I shouldn't expect to use fancy sword \Ntechniques when I'm made of bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:06.95,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,But what about my other abilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.41,0:11:10.47,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,All living things draw on their \Nvital energy for strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:12.11,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Their spirit energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.71,0:11:16.28,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,It's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.67,0:11:20.97,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Right now, you and I are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:22.54,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Our strength is equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.78,0:11:26.29,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,But my equipment gives me an advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.69,0:11:30.51,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,If I use my spirit energy to buff my \Nphysical abilities and raise my attack power...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.40,0:11:43.90,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Is it still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.59,0:11:55.53,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I'm recovering the spirit \Nenergy I just expended?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.72,0:11:58.53,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.34,0:12:02.70,Flashback,LORRAINE,0,0,0,,Monsters have a mysterious trait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.25,0:12:09.05,Flashback,LORRAINE,0,0,0,,With time and experience, \Nthey evolve into greater beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.67,0:12:11.67,Flashback,RENTT,0,0,0,,So do humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.67,0:12:13.86,Flashback,RENTT,0,0,0,,We grow with training.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:16.39,Flashback,LORRAINE,0,0,0,,They're on another level.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.39,0:12:21.16,Flashback,LORRAINE,0,0,0,,For example, a skeleton is \Ntypically a skeleton forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.16,0:12:24.90,Flashback,LORRAINE,0,0,0,,But on rare occasions, \Nthey evolve into ghouls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.90,0:12:25.94,Flashback,LORRAINE,0,0,0,,It's known as
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.02,0:12:28.90,Flashback,LORRAINE,0,0,0,,existential evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:31.69,Flashback,RENTT,0,0,0,,Existential evolution...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.97,0:12:35.48,Flashback,LORRAINE,0,0,0,,Yes. It's one of the \Nsubjects I'm researching.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.41,0:12:39.30,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Existential evolution, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.01,0:12:44.77,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Ghouls are also undead, but they \Nhave flesh and are closer to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.22,0:12:48.76,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,If I use robes and masks to hide my form, \NI may be able to return to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.32,0:12:52.46,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,All right. I should aim to achieve \Nexistential evolution first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.36,0:12:57.31,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I'll defeat monsters in this \Nlabyrinth and become a ghoul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:07.49,Main,LORRAINE,0,0,0,,He didn't come today, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.61,0:13:09.65,Main,LORRAINE,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.09,0:13:12.17,Main,LORRAINE,0,0,0,,I'll make dinner myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.58,0:13:16.37,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,That's five!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.74,0:13:21.04,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,My mobility has been mostly restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.27,0:13:28.50,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Anyway, it seems like this light heals me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.17,0:13:32.71,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Because of it, I can use spirit \Nenergy during every battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.05,0:13:36.14,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I'll try taking on some \Nstronger monsters next.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.27,0:13:47.52,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,Like skeletons, slimes are \Nan archetypal weak monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.52,0:13:49.07,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,but they mustn't be underestimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.65,0:13:54.31,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,Physical attacks are less effective \Nagainst amorphous liquid monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:57.28,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,Magic is the easy way to beat them,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.28,0:14:01.14,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,but unfortunately, I don't have the \Nability to use offensive magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.51,0:14:04.87,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,The most I can do is start fires \Nsuitable for domestic tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.42,0:14:08.34,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,So I'll have to use physical \Nattacks to defeat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.34,0:14:10.21,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,There are two ways to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.21,0:14:16.55,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,Pierce its core, or break apart its \Nliquid form until it can't regenerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.93,0:14:19.69,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,Lacking in both skill and strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.69,0:14:24.30,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,once a day I can expend my reserves \Nof spirit energy to defeat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:27.85,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,You could say slimes are my greatest enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.83,0:14:39.78,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.27,0:14:43.87,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Looks like I got lucky and \Nmy blade struck its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.57,0:14:47.20,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,First I'll retrieve its magic stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.22,0:14:52.03,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Slimes have the ability \Nto launch an Acid Blitz,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.03,0:14:54.96,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,but no acid remains in their \Nbody once they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.44,0:14:59.05,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,In fact, sticking your hand in \Nthe stuff makes your skin smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.05,0:15:03.64,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Clear slime fluids are used \Nto make cosmetics for women.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.99,0:15:08.26,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Surely we don't have to make \Ncosmetics out of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.26,0:15:12.29,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Women's desire for beauty must be endless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:16.90,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,This'll pay for several days at an inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.90,0:15:18.07,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.80,0:15:26.51,Main,SHEILA,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.11,0:15:28.10,Main,WORKER A,0,0,0,,Sheila.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.10,0:15:29.25,Main,SHEILA,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.25,0:15:31.83,Main,WORKER A,0,0,0,,Has that newbie found a party yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.83,0:15:34.96,Main,WORKER A,0,0,0,,Her letter of introduction said \Nshe lacks combat experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.96,0:15:36.69,Main,WORKER A,0,0,0,,but she seems all right with a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.13,0:15:41.92,Main,SHEILA,0,0,0,,There wasn't a suitable opening for them, \Nso I was going to ask Rentt,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.68,0:15:45.05,Main,SHEILA,0,0,0,,but he hasn't been back since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.60,0:15:47.35,Main,WORKER A,0,0,0,,That's unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.35,0:15:49.69,Main,WORKER A,0,0,0,,He hasn't accepted a long-term job, has he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.69,0:15:53.35,Main,SHEILA,0,0,0,,No, nothing that would take him out of Maalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.98,0:16:00.94,Main,SHEILA,0,0,0,,I told the newbie I'd introduce her to a \Nhelpful veteran if she waited a few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.22,0:16:03.19,Main,SHEILA,0,0,0,,but she seemed pressed for money,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:05.74,Main,SHEILA,0,0,0,,so I told her about the \NLabyrinth of The Moon's Reflection.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.74,0:16:06.94,Main,WORKER A,0,0,0,,That should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.32,0:16:10.58,Main,WORKER A,0,0,0,,Even a newbie should be able to handle it, \Nif they're decent with a swordd.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:14.04,Main,SHEILA,0,0,0,,Right. I did warn her \Nnot to overdo it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.90,0:16:23.42,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I don't feel sleepy at all, \Nand I don't feel hungry, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.84,0:16:26.98,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I guess that's obvious since I'm undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.98,0:16:29.39,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Anything I ate would probably \Nfall to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.01,0:16:33.43,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I fought all night since I might as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.43,0:16:36.98,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,but it seems like existential \Nevolution takes longer than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.02,0:16:42.13,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,My physical abilities were significantly \Nworse right after I became a skeleton,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.13,0:16:46.42,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,but I'm mostly back to normal \Nafter defeating those monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.13,0:16:49.41,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I tested my spirit energy, \Nand it still works.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.67,0:16:52.20,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I can use my mana, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.51,0:17:00.63,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I can even use my divinity \Ndespite being undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.24,0:17:04.48,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I don't want to waste it. \NI'll use it on this bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.10,0:17:09.12,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,In addition to curing injuries and illnesses,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.12,0:17:14.68,Narration,RENTT,0,0,0,,divinity is a useful power that can \Npurify water and delay spoiling in food.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.17,0:17:18.01,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Okay. That should make \Nit last three more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.91,0:17:22.83,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I hope I'll have a body that \Nneeds bread three days from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.88,0:17:26.09,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,There's no point in thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.09,0:17:28.33,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I should focus on achieving \Nexistential evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:33.80,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I'll play it safe for a while \Nand steadily defeat monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.16,0:17:36.97,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I can beat one or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.37,0:17:39.21,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Three would be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.88,0:17:41.67,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,If I encounter four, I'll run.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.00,0:17:43.50,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,And more than five...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.11,0:17:48.59,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,It's unlikely I'll encounter groups \Nthat large in this labyrinth,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.59,0:17:51.73,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,but if I do, I'm screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.73,0:17:53.43,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,That would be the end of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.05,0:17:59.26,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I'm so weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.74,0:18:02.86,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,It's been ten years since \NI became an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.37,0:18:06.53,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,If you include my training time \Nbefore that, it's been twenty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.53,0:18:10.92,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Not only that, but even \Nhigh-ranking adventurers rarely
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:13.99,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,have spirit energy, mana, and divinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.63,0:18:18.65,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I wish I had just one strong power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.66,0:18:25.93,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I know I'm not cut out to be an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.16,0:18:33.31,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Normally, people give up on \Nadventuring after a few years
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.31,0:18:37.99,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,and return to their village \Nto farm or find another job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.75,0:18:43.12,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,But I figured as long as I'm alive, \NI'd manage somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.73,0:18:46.42,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I trained every day without fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.03,0:18:50.43,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I asked an acquaintance to teach \Nme about monsters and magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.20,0:18:53.58,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I accepted even the most minor jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.30,0:18:58.18,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I did that for ten years to achieve my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.02,0:19:02.43,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,To become a mithril-class adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.13,0:19:07.00,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Higher than gold- and platinum-class,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.50,0:19:11.25,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,not even naturally gifted people \Neasily reach the highest rank
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.25,0:19:15.34,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,of adventurers who have saved entire nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.88,0:19:22.08,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I will become mithril-class.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.99,0:19:25.03,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,It's what I've lived for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.90,0:19:28.99,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Becoming a skeleton won't stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.36,0:19:41.22,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.65,0:19:44.79,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get stronger \Nthan I was as a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.83,0:20:01.01,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.42,0:20:02.79,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,It's not a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.38,0:20:05.60,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I'm getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.58,0:20:10.19,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I can sell these materials. \NI should gather some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.61,0:20:14.14,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I'm lucky to acquire more clear slime fluid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.14,0:20:17.26,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Slimes are fairly gross after \Nthey've eaten something,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.26,0:20:19.08,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,so their fluids can't be sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.09,0:20:30.55,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Wha— What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.85,0:21:09.32,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I'm a ghoul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.99,0:21:14.01,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I'm a creepy dried-out corpse, \Nbut I have flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.44,0:21:16.47,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,This is major progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.85,0:21:20.95,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,If I keep working hard, I might be able \Nto become even higher ranking undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.29,0:21:22.35,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.35,0:21:25.43,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Vampires practically look human.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.43,0:21:28.40,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I have a fleshy body now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.95,0:21:37.93,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,Okay, I can make noises.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.77,0:21:45.40,Main,RENTT,0,0,0,,Hello... hello...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.40,0:21:49.58,Main,RENTT,0,0,0,,Good morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.66,0:21:54.55,Italics,RENTT,0,0,0,,I'll have to practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.16,0:21:59.88,Main,RENTT,0,0,0,,Hello... hello...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.88,0:22:03.93,Main,RENTT,0,0,0,,I am Rentt...
